OL,3,GNEWSASt Nicholas Market 'could open
OL,4,Asome evenings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hugely popular city centre market
OL,7,Fcould open on Sundays and weekend
OL,8,Fevenings under new proposals.
OL,10,FLater on Monday Bristol City Council
OL,11,Fwill discuss a new vision for St
OL,12,FNicholas Market, according to the Local
OL,13,FDemocracy Reporting Service.
OL,15,FIt comes a year after traders clashed
OL,16,Fwith Bristol City Council over
OL,17,Fproposals to increase fees. However,
OL,18,Fthe move was deferred after more than
OL,19,F5,000 people signed a petition against
OL,20,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
