OL,3,GNEWSASt Nicholas Market 'could open
OL,4,Asome evenings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders in the market, which dates back
OL,7,Fto the late 1700s, say they are hopeful
OL,8,Fthat the formation of a new stakeholder
OL,9,Fgroup will give them a "proper voice".
